WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.960
In this challenge episode

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:01.680
we’re gonna attempt the

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.180
20 candle extinguishing shot

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.260
Team up with the world’s

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.180
best trampoliners

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.020
and more...

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.020
Let’s get into it!

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.160
First one 

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.940
to miss the cup

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:11.880
loses...

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.240
200 cups

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.220
Don't miss the shot!

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.460
You lost before it even started!

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.060
It shouldn't be that hard!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.380
What if you lose this?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.740
We have to come up with the punishment

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.900
Otto’s smash to the back!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.380
We know it comes hard!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.440
Don't miss the ball!

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.320
Was that a good strategy?

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.160
No it wasn't...

00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.940
It almost came back!

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:03.780
Don't worry guys

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:04.920
I got your back!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.820
He’s doing a warm up already

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.080
It went into the cup!

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:34.980
It fell!

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:40.000
I think you can clearly see

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:40.760
the ball

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.140
is not in the cup!

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.720
Thank you very much!

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:46.340
Hey what racket are you using?

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.300
One warm up!

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:55.580
What?!

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:04.740
Yeah that hurts!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.420
Sorry Miikka

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.760
A genuine sorry from Otto!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.120
Next, we're going to blow out

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.400
as many candles as possible

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.740
in one single shot

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.540
First one!

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.140
I heard that you tried to blow out

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.700
three candles

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.440
but it never happened

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.060
We tried it four different days

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:24.820
Or something

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:25.680
To get the triple candle

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.580
but never got it

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.360
But I have to say

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:30.360
this is a bit easier

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.000
We’re gonna do at least 20 today

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.260
It came back alive!

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.380
It's very convenient

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.580
because you don't have to put it back

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.240
I can't believe that it worked!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.220
This is the first viral trick

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:49.560
that we ever did!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:52.260
This is the thing where it started for us!

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:52.960
that went viral

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.120
Like, completely viral!

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.360
Please show us six!

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.280
Six seemed to be too easy...

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.380
We're going straight to ten!

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.140
I wonder how far we can take this?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.180
At least 20

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.580
That's the new record!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:27.820
I think let's go to 20!

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:29.640
Yeah I think so too

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.980
There is no way this is happening...

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:33.920
It will happen!

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.220
We're jumping from 10 to 20

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.580
Normal day!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.640
It's nine only

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:57.760
Is that a new record?

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.140
It's 11!

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:01.800
A new world record

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:02.640
11!

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.700
But we're not happy with that

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.140
No we're not having that...

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.400
It’s a new record Emil!

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.220
It’s 12!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.880
We got it! 

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.800
I guess 12 is the new world record

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:42.380
Hit the hardest that you can!

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.840
I don't like that one

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:49.680
How many do you want?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.980
Well as many as you can fit there

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.960
Maximum speed forehand!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.780
I feel like I didn't even move my hands

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.080
The final weight of the puzzle

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.840
53 lbs added weight!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.820
I’m hitting as hard as I can!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.260
I felt like I was in a

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.420
slow motion movie all the time

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.220
Now it'll be super interesting

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.260
to see him play without the weights!

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.580
I've never seen him move like that!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.260
I think we can make that work

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.300
That was incredible!

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:58.240
Smooth!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.100
It was in!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:06.260
That was nice!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.420
First try!

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.200
That was a hard return!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.720
That’s insane!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.920
It's scarily close to the bar!

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.880
We've done the backflip shot

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.720
so now we're going to do the double backflip!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:05.700
We’re gonna get this!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.140
That's incredible!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.320
It actually came on the table!

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.300
Was it in?

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:17.560
It was in!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.820
It actually went on my side!

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.400
That’s talent

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:39.520
Shall we call it a day?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.340
From out of nowhere!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.460
That is evidence!

